  "name": "炼金盆栽 2",
  "prompt": "生成11个彼此独立的魔法炼金工坊盆栽变体，每个素材严格只能包含一个花盆，禁止一个素材中出现多个花盆、组合盆栽、托盘组合或场景底座。系列包含3个大型盆栽、3个中型盆栽、3个小型盆栽和2个只有泥土且完全没有植物的空盆。植物种类要多样：可分别表现浅色阔叶草、银白蕨、淡黄药草、浅青垂叶、嫩绿剑叶、浅色卷叶草、淡蓝肉质叶、浅黄小花草和灰绿色细叶草；每个有植物的变体只种一种植物。花盆与土必须偏深色，花盆使用#52362E、#714D48或#8E664D，泥土使用#52362E；植物可使用色卡中的#FFF7A8、#F1F5AF、#DEE5BC、#C6CC97、#AEAF6F、#76904C、#D8F7EF、#B8ECDD、#90DCC8、#DAF2F5或#B2E9F2。普通材质base或vertex color只能从以下色卡选取：#FFFDF6,#FEF9EA,#FDF2D7,#E9DABD,#CDBA97,#F8E8CF,#F1D7B2,#E7C393,#C9A06E,#9E7A55,#FFF7A8,#FCEF72,#F6E24B,#D1B825,#9C8510,#FFF3B7,#FDE674,#\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=0.9, height=1.65, depth=0.9 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.\nCreate variation 2 of 8; preserve the same reusable asset family while varying silhouette and details.",
